msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"These are special boxes containing new and unique items, including Premium "
"vehicles, 3D styles, days of WoT Premium Account, and more."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/title"
msgstr "Holiday Ops Large Boxes"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningDescription"
msgstr ""
"Boxes cannot currently be opened or purchased due to technical reasons. We "
"apologize for the temporary inconvenience."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningTitle"
msgstr "Holiday Ops Large Boxes Temporarily Unavailable"

msgid "eventName/lowerCase"
msgstr "Holiday Ops Large Boxes"

msgid "eventName/upperCase"
msgstr "HOLIDAY OPS LARGE BOXES"

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Every %(guaranteed0)s Holiday Ops Large Boxes are guaranteed to contain a "
"Tier VIII–X vehicle. If you open them without one dropping such a vehicle, "
"then a Tier VIII–X vehicle you do not already own will drop when you open "
"the %(guaranteed0)s&zwnbsp;th Large Box. When it does, the counter is reset."

msgid "infoPage/header/description"
msgstr ""
"Open Large Boxes for the chance to receive valuable in-game items! See more "
"details below."

msgid "preview/backLabel"
msgstr "TO LARGE BOXES"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/finish/header"
msgstr "Holiday Ops 2026 has ended"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/finish/text"
msgstr ""
"All remaining Holiday Ops Large Boxes will be opened. Their contents will be"
" added to your account."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/count"
msgstr "Boxes opened: %(boxes)s"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/header"
msgstr "Remaining Large Boxes Opened"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/text"
msgstr ""
"At the end of the event, we opened all of your Holiday Ops Large Boxes and "
"added their contents to your account."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/start/header"
msgstr "Holiday Ops 2026 has started"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/start/text"
msgstr ""
"Only until %(date)s: Premium vehicles, 3D styles, 3D customization elements,"
" and valuable in-game assets!"

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all vehicles from the list of possible box contents, then"
" all subsequent vehicles you receive from boxes will be compensated in gold."

